OL,3,GNEWSAPolice searching for Noah Woods,
OL,4,A3, say they have found body of a child
OL,5,Ain lake
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice searching for three-year-old
OL,8,FNoah Woods say they have found the body
OL,9,Fof a child in a lake, known as Decoy
OL,10,FPond
OL,12,FFormal identification is yet to take
OL,13,Fplace, but police say Noah's family
OL,14,Fhave been informed
OL,16,FNoah, who is partially deaf and
OL,17,Fnon-verbal, went missing from a
OL,18,Fplayground in Brantham, Suffolk on
OL,19,FTuesday afternoon
